// Test: WebSocket connection test
// Spec: 15-PROTOCOLS.md § 5 WebSocket Support
// Priority: P2 - Nice to Have
//
// Tests WebSocket connection API exists and returns proper Result
// Note: This is a stub test - full WebSocket I/O is not yet implemented

rite main() {
    // Try to connect to WebSocket server
    ≔ result = WebSocket·connect("ws://echo.websocket.org");

    // Result should be Ok(connection) or Err(message)
    // For this test, any valid Result proves the API works
    ≔ output = ⌥ result {
        Ok(_) => "OK",
        Err(_) => "OK",
    };
    println(output);
}
